      <item>
        <title>Version 1.0.0</title>
        <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
        <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
        <sparkle:edSignature>...EdDSA signature from sign_update...</sparkle:edSignature>
        <enclosure
          url="https://github.com/darkbringer1/menuutils/releases/download/v1.0.0/MenuUtils-1.0.0.dmg"
          sparkle:edSignature="..."
          length="..."
          type="application/octet-stream" />
      </item>

      The enclosure URL points at the GitHub Release asset. SUPublicEDKey in
      App/Sources/Info-Direct.plist must match the key used to sign the appcast.
    -->
  </channel>
